    <h2>4. Project Scope</h2>

    <h3>4.1 Included Features</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>User registration and authentication.</li>
        <li>Subject and academic task management.</li>
        <li>Deadline and priority management.</li>
        <li>Daily and weekly study planning.</li>
        <li>Task completion tracking.</li>
        <li>Progress summaries and reminders.</li>
        <li>Basic task-prioritization recommendations.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>4.2 Limitations</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>The initial version will focus on individual students.</li>
        <li>Recommendations will depend on the quality of user-provided data.</li>
        <li>Advanced machine-learning features may require a later development phase.</li>
        <li>Some features may require an internet connection.</li>
